{"id":"31f962b1eba87e25","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration.md","title":"种子枚举的多数模拟","display":"prop-prg-seed-enumeration — 种子枚举的多数模拟","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration","aliases":["28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration"],"display":"prop-prg-seed-enumeration — 种子枚举的多数模拟","depends_on":["[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 20.3, finite correctness step","source_printed_pages":"404–405","source_pdf_pages":"430–431","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-prg-seed-enumeration — 种子枚举的多数模拟"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d42ba324c0358975\" href=\"?note=d42ba324c0358975\" title=\"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness\">28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 20.3, finite correctness step"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"404–405"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"430–431"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\epsilon&lt;1/6\">\\(0&lt;\\epsilon&lt;1/6\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^a\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L:\\Sigma^a\\to\\Sigma\">\\(\\chi_L:\\Sigma^a\\to\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in L\">\\(\\chi_L(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\Sigma^a\\times\\Sigma^m\\to\\Sigma\">\\(A:\\Sigma^a\\times\\Sigma^m\\to\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m\">\\(G:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m\\)</span>。\n对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Sigma^a\">\\(x\\in\\Sigma^a\\)</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_x\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)\">\\(C_x\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_{C_x}(r)_1=A(x,r)\">\\(\\operatorname{out}_{C_x}(r)_1=A(x,r)\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\Sigma^m\">\\(r\\in\\Sigma^m\\)</span> 成立。测试类与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fool}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fool}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d42ba324c0358975\" href=\"?note=d42ba324c0358975\" title=\"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness\">28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeedMajority}_{A,G}(x)\\coloneqq\\iota b\\in\\Sigma\\;\\left[b=1\\leftrightarrow\\left|\\{z\\in\\Sigma^\\ell:A(x,G(z))=1\\}\\right|&gt;2^{\\ell-1}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SeedMajority}_{A,G}(x)\\coloneqq\\iota b\\in\\Sigma\\;\\left[b=1\\leftrightarrow\\left|\\{z\\in\\Sigma^\\ell:A(x,G(z))=1\\}\\right|&gt;2^{\\ell-1}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\left[\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^a\\;\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_m}[A(x,r)=\\chi_L(x)]\\ge\\tfrac23\\right]\\land\\operatorname{Fool}_m(G(U_\\ell);s,\\epsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\left[\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^a\\;\\Pr_{z\\leftarrow U_\\ell}[A(x,G(z))=\\chi_L(x)]&gt;\\tfrac23-\\epsilon&gt;\\tfrac12\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\left[\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^a\\;\\operatorname{SeedMajority}_{A,G}(x)=\\chi_L(x)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\left[\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^a\\;\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_m}[A(x,r)=\\chi_L(x)]\\ge\\tfrac23\\right]\\land\\operatorname{Fool}_m(G(U_\\ell);s,\\epsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\left[\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^a\\;\\Pr_{z\\leftarrow U_\\ell}[A(x,G(z))=\\chi_L(x)]&gt;\\tfrac23-\\epsilon&gt;\\tfrac12\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\left[\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^a\\;\\operatorname{SeedMajority}_{A,G}(x)=\\chi_L(x)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>局部证明：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_x\">\\(C_x\\)</span> 的接受概率改变严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span>。如果正确答案为零，正确概率是接受概率的补，改变绝对值相同；所以两种答案的成功概率都大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2/3-\\epsilon&gt;1/2\">\\(2/3-\\epsilon&gt;1/2\\)</span>。多数阈值因此给出正确答案，平票不会发生。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 定义良好，因为布尔条件恰好选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span> 中的一个；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell=0\">\\(\\ell=0\\)</span> 时阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2\">\\(1/2\\)</span>，同一推导仍适用。本命题只断言有限正确性；枚举的运行时间另在对数种子模拟命题中分析。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness","status":"resolved","id":"d42ba324c0358975","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness","status":"resolved","id":"d42ba324c0358975","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$a,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N$，$m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$s\\in\\mathbb N$，$0<\\epsilon<1/6$。\n$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^a$，$\\chi_L:\\Sigma^a\\to\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\chi_L(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in L$；$A:\\Sigma^a\\times\\Sigma^m\\to\\Sigma$；$G:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m$。\n对每个 $x\\in\\Sigma^a$，存在 $C_x\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)$，且 $\\operatorname{out}_{C_x}(r)_1=A(x,r)$ 对所有 $r\\in\\Sigma^m$ 成立。测试类与 $\\operatorname{Fool}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0<\\epsilon<1/6","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^a","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_L:\\Sigma^a\\to\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_L(x)=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\Sigma^a\\times\\Sigma^m\\to\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\Sigma^a","display":false},{"tex":"C_x\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}_{C_x}(r)_1=A(x,r)","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\Sigma^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SeedMajority}_{A,G}(x)\\coloneqq\\iota b\\in\\Sigma\\;\\left[b=1\\leftrightarrow\\left|\\{z\\in\\Sigma^\\ell:A(x,G(z))=1\\}\\right|>2^{\\ell-1}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\left[\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^a\\;\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_m}[A(x,r)=\\chi_L(x)]\\ge\\tfrac23\\right]\\land\\operatorname{Fool}_m(G(U_\\ell);s,\\epsilon)\\\\\n&\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\left[\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^a\\;\\Pr_{z\\leftarrow U_\\ell}[A(x,G(z))=\\chi_L(x)]>\\tfrac23-\\epsilon>\\tfrac12\\right]\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\left[\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^a\\;\\operatorname{SeedMajority}_{A,G}(x)=\\chi_L(x)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"C_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"2/3-\\epsilon>1/2","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell=0","display":false},{"tex":"1/2","display":false}],"bytes":2382,"backlinks":[{"id":"99a8573dd28105ee","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-251","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第20章：去随机化与NW构造：[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-df-derandomization-prg]]、[[28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration]]、[[28-cor-log-seed-derandomization]]、[[28-df-nw-design]]、[[28-df-nw-generator]]、[[28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit]]、[[28-lem-nw-design-existence]]、[[28-lem-nw-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-thm-hardness-derandomization]]。"}],"outgoing":["d42ba324c0358975"]}